      "paperId": "7ec92d8177b53b10ec019903fb345c4633ef880a",
      "title": "\u00abMore problematist than the writer...\u00bb. On the contribution of R.N. Kim to the concept of translating Japanese literature into Russian (based on prison correspondence with M.S. Tsyn)",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "A. E. Kulanov",
          "authorId": "122556332"
