      "paperId": "f5451fc7c3246a4776d9a82da2f0b2816c5bc27a",
      "title": "THEORETICAL TRENDS OF RECEPTION AND AESTHETICS IN VISUAL ARTS AND LITERATURE",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Bachir Djaid",
